{"id":10365,"slug":"10365-tai-sao-khong-nen-dung-model-class-trong-migration-cach-xu-ly-dung-khi-can-migra","category":"Rails","subcategory":"Migration & DB","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Tại sao không nên dùng model class trong migration? Cách xử lý đúng khi cần migrate data.","question_en":"Why should you not reference a model class in a migration? How do you properly handle data migrations?","answer_vi":"Gọi model class (VD: `User.update_all(...)`) trong migration nguy hiểm vì model thay đổi theo thời gian — migration cũ sẽ fail khi replay (setup fresh DB) vì model không còn method/association đó nữa.\n\n**Sai:**\n```ruby\nclass BackfillUserRole < ActiveRecord::Migration[7.1]\n  def up\n    User.where(role: nil).update_all(role: \"member\")  # nguy hiểm!\n  end\nend\n```\n\n**Đúng — dùng anonymous model hoặc raw SQL:**\n```ruby\nclass BackfillUserRole < ActiveRecord::Migration[7.1]\n  # Anonymous class chỉ biết schema hiện tại của migration này\n  class User < ApplicationRecord; end\n\n  def up\n    User.where(role: nil).update_all(role: \"member\")\n  end\nend\n\n# Hoặc đơn giản hơn:\ndef up\n  execute \"UPDATE users SET role = 'member' WHERE role IS NULL\"\nend\n```","answer_en":"Referencing a model class (e.g. `User.update_all(...)`) in a migration is dangerous because the model evolves over time — old migrations break when replayed on a fresh DB because the model no longer has that method/association.\n\n**Wrong:**\n```ruby\nclass BackfillUserRole < ActiveRecord::Migration[7.1]\n  def up\n    User.where(role: nil).update_all(role: \"member\")  # dangerous!\n  end\nend\n```\n\n**Right — use an anonymous model or raw SQL:**\n```ruby\nclass BackfillUserRole < ActiveRecord::Migration[7.1]\n  # Anonymous class only knows the schema at the time of this migration\n  class User < ApplicationRecord; end\n\n  def up\n    User.where(role: nil).update_all(role: \"member\")\n  end\nend\n\n# Or simpler:\ndef up\n  execute \"UPDATE users SET role = 'member' WHERE role IS NULL\"\nend\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Gọi model class (VD: <code>User.update_all(...)</code>) trong migration nguy hiểm vì model thay đổi theo thời gian — migration cũ sẽ fail khi replay (setup fresh DB) vì model không còn method/association đó nữa.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Sai:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class BackfillUserRole &lt; ActiveRecord::Migration[7.1]\n  def up\n    User.where(role: nil).update_all(role: &quot;member&quot;)  # nguy hiểm!\n  end\nend\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">BackfillUserRole</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ActiveRecord::Migration</span>[<span class=\"hljs-number\">7.1</span>]\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">up</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>.where(<span class=\"hljs-symbol\">role:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">nil</span>).update_all(<span class=\"hljs-symbol\">role:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;member&quot;</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># nguy hiểm!</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Đúng — dùng anonymous model hoặc raw SQL:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class BackfillUserRole &lt; ActiveRecord::Migration[7.1]\n  # Anonymous class chỉ biết schema hiện tại của migration này\n  class User &lt; ApplicationRecord; end\n\n  def up\n    User.where(role: nil).update_all(role: &quot;member&quot;)\n  end\nend\n\n# Hoặc đơn giản hơn:\ndef up\n  execute &quot;UPDATE users SET role = 'member' WHERE role IS NULL&quot;\nend\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">BackfillUserRole</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ActiveRecord::Migration</span>[<span class=\"hljs-number\">7.1</span>]\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Anonymous class chỉ biết schema hiện tại của migration này</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ApplicationRecord</span>; <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">up</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>.where(<span class=\"hljs-symbol\">role:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">nil</span>).update_all(<span class=\"hljs-symbol\">role:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;member&quot;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Hoặc đơn giản hơn:</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">up</span>\n  execute <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UPDATE users SET role = &#x27;member&#x27; WHERE role IS NULL&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span></code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Referencing a model class (e.g. <code>User.update_all(...)</code>) in a migration is dangerous because the model evolves over time — old migrations break when replayed on a fresh DB because the model no longer has that method/association.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Wrong:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class BackfillUserRole &lt; ActiveRecord::Migration[7.1]\n  def up\n    User.where(role: nil).update_all(role: &quot;member&quot;)  # dangerous!\n  end\nend\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">BackfillUserRole</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ActiveRecord::Migration</span>[<span class=\"hljs-number\">7.1</span>]\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">up</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>.where(<span class=\"hljs-symbol\">role:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">nil</span>).update_all(<span class=\"hljs-symbol\">role:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;member&quot;</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># dangerous!</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Right — use an anonymous model or raw SQL:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class BackfillUserRole &lt; ActiveRecord::Migration[7.1]\n  # Anonymous class only knows the schema at the time of this migration\n  class User &lt; ApplicationRecord; end\n\n  def up\n    User.where(role: nil).update_all(role: &quot;member&quot;)\n  end\nend\n\n# Or simpler:\ndef up\n  execute &quot;UPDATE users SET role = 'member' WHERE role IS NULL&quot;\nend\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">BackfillUserRole</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ActiveRecord::Migration</span>[<span class=\"hljs-number\">7.1</span>]\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Anonymous class only knows the schema at the time of this migration</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ApplicationRecord</span>; <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">up</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>.where(<span class=\"hljs-symbol\">role:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">nil</span>).update_all(<span class=\"hljs-symbol\">role:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;member&quot;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Or simpler:</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">up</span>\n  execute <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UPDATE users SET role = &#x27;member&#x27; WHERE role IS NULL&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span></code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"Rails Guides — Active Record Migrations (Using Models in Migrations)","url":"https://guides.rubyonrails.org/active_record_migrations.html#using-models-in-your-migrations"},{"label":"Toptal — Top Rails Interview Questions","url":"https://www.toptal.com/ruby-on-rails/interview-questions"},{"label":"Viblo — Tổng hợp câu hỏi kỹ thuật Ruby Dev Phần 2","url":"https://vibl